  "Saving from any Mac app writes straight to the phone. Finder's own droppings (.DS_Store and ._ sidecars) are discarded rather than stored. Moving a file between folders isn't supported — rename in place, or use the Files tab.": "在任意 Mac 应用中保存都会直接写入手机。访达自己生成的文件（.DS_Store 和 ._ 附属文件）会被丢弃而不会存入。不支持在文件夹之间移动文件——请原地重命名，或使用“文件”标签页。",
