  "Sends keystrokes as a virtual USB keyboard, which fixes non-Latin layouts and games. Changes how every key reaches the phone, so it's off by default. Needs scrcpy 2.4 or newer.": "以虚拟 USB 键盘的方式发送按键，可解决非拉丁键盘布局和游戏中的输入问题。它会改变每一次按键到达手机的方式，因此默认关闭。需要 scrcpy 2.4 或更高版本。",
